From 395532829e063a1172817bcd6963168c9c65985f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Parthiban Nallathambi <parthiban@linumiz.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 22:52:07 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] v850: Add FXU registers and multilib

Add the 128 bit wr vector registers, the V4SF and V4SI modes and their
calling convention for the FXU. Vectors and saved wr registers change
the alignment of library structures, so add an FXU multilib.

Signed-off-by: Parthiban Nallathambi <parthiban@linumiz.com>
